# Every scratch build directory, not just the default one. `.build/` alone was
# what was here, and it did not cover `.build-old/` or `.build-nodyn/` — two
# names invented on the spot for toolchain comparisons, each then swept into a
# commit by `git add -A`. Six thousand files and a third of a gigabyte of
# object code and dSYMs.
.build*/
build/
.swiftpm/
*.xcodeproj
.DS_Store

# Agent worktrees live here and are not part of the project.
.claude/worktrees/
build/screenshots/

# Working notes, kept on disk and out of the repository.
#
# `TODO.md` is an engineering diary — 1362 lines of post-mortems and settled
# arguments, in Chinese, when every document here is in English. It is genuinely
# useful and it is useful to *us*: what a reader needs from it is the open items,
# and those belong in the issue tracker where they can be answered.
#
# `CLAUDE.md` routes an AI tool to `AGENTS.md` and contains nothing that is not
# already there.
TODO.md
CLAUDE.md

# Local working notes use dated or planning-oriented names; the reference
# documentation above remains the public source of measured product behaviour.
docs/*-audit-*.md
docs/*-hardening.md
docs/*-evidence-plan.md
ci/*-evidence-manifest.sh
